    "sample": "\n<div class=\"section-banner-tech\">\n  <div class=\"banner-badge\">SECTION A</div>\n  <div class=\"banner-title\">Physics</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"section-instruction-tech\">Answer all questions. Marks for each question are indicated against it.</div>\n<div class=\"tech-q-row\">\n  <div class=\"tech-q-num\">Q.1</div>\n  <div class=\"tech-q-body\">A body of mass 2 kg moves with velocity \\(v = 3t^2\\). Find the force acting on it at \\(t = 2\\,\\text{s}\\).</div>\n  <div class=\"tech-q-mark\"><span>[2 pts]</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tech-q-row\">\n  <div class=\"tech-q-num\">Q.2</div>\n  <div class=\"tech-q-body\">State and prove the work&ndash;energy theorem for a variable force.</div>\n  <div class=\"tech-q-mark\"><span>[3 pts]</span></div>\n</div>",
