    "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Question Paper</title>\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cinzel:wght@600;800&family=Lora:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;1,400&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<script>\n  window.MathJax = {\n    tex: {\n      inlineMath: [['$', '$'], ['\\\\(', '\\\\)']],\n      displayMath: [['$$', '$$'], ['\\\\[', '\\\\]']],\n      processEscapes: true,\n      processEnvironments: true\n    },\n    options: {\n      skipHtmlTags: ['script', 'noscript', 'style', 'textarea', 'pre', 'code'],\n      enableMenu: false\n    },\n    chtml: {\n      displayAlign: 'left',\n      scale: 0.95,\n      minScale: 0.7,\n      matchFontHeight: false\n    },\n    svg: {\n      scale: 0.95,\n      minScale: 0.7,\n      matchFontHeight: false\n    }\n  };\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    font-family: 'Lora', serif;\n    background-color: #ffffff;\n    color: #1e293b;\n    padding: 16px;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n  .page { width: 100%; position: relative; max-width: 960px; margin: 0 auto; }\n  .executive-header {\n    border-top: 2.5px double #b45309;\n    border-bottom: 2.5px double #b45309;\n    padding: 10px 0;\n    margin-bottom: 14px;\n    text-align: center;\n    break-inside: avoid;\n    break-after: avoid;\n  }\n  .exec-logo {\n    height: 48px;\n    margin-bottom: 4px;\n  }\n  .exec-org-title {\n    font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    color: #1e3a8a;\n    letter-spacing: 1.5px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n  .executive-meta {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    margin: 10px 0 0 0;\n    font-size: 9.5px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;\n    padding-top: 6px;\n  }\n  .executive-sec-header {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: baseline;\n    border-bottom: 1.5px solid #b45309;\n    padding-bottom: 3px;\n    margin: 10px 0 4px 0;\n    break-inside: avoid;\n    break-after: avoid;\n  }\n  .executive-badge {\n    font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #b45309;\n    margin-right: 8px;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n  }\n  .executive-title {\n    font-size: 11.5px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #1e3a8a;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n  }\n  .executive-instruction {\n    font-size: 9.5px;\n    font-style: italic;\n    color: #64748b;\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n    break-inside: avoid;\n    break-after: avoid;\n  }\n  .exec-q-row {\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\n    padding: 4px 8px;\n    border-left: 2.5px solid #b45309;\n    background: #fafaf9;\n    break-inside: avoid;\n    page-break-inside: avoid;\n    min-width: 0;\n  }\n  .exec-q-meta {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    font-size: 9.5px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #b45309;\n    margin-bottom: 3px;\n  }\n  .exec-q-num {\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n  }\n  .exec-q-body {\n    font-size: 9.5pt;\n    line-height: 1.45;\n    color: #0f172a;\n    word-break: break-word !important;\n    overflow-wrap: anywhere !important;\n    word-wrap: break-word !important;\n  }\n\n  /* MathJax LaTeX Automatic Line Breaking & Zero Scrollbars */\n  mjx-container,\n  .MathJax,\n  .MathJax_Display,\n  .mjx-chtml {\n    display: inline !important;\n    max-width: 100% !important;\n    overflow: visible !important;\n    overflow-x: visible !important;\n    overflow-y: visible !important;\n    white-space: normal !important;\n    word-break: break-word !important;\n    overflow-wrap: anywhere !important;\n    scrollbar-width: none !important;\n    -ms-overflow-style: none !important;\n  }\n  mjx-container::-webkit-scrollbar,\n  .MathJax::-webkit-scrollbar,\n  .MathJax_Display::-webkit-scrollbar {\n    display: none !important;\n    width: 0 !important;\n    height: 0 !important;\n  }\n  mjx-container[jax=\"CHTML\"][display=\"true\"] {\n    display: block !important;\n    text-align: left !important;\n    margin: 4px 0 !important;\n    max-width: 100% !important;\n    overflow: visible !important;\n    overflow-x: visible !important;\n    white-space: normal !important;\n  }\n  mjx-math {\n    white-space: normal !important;\n    word-break: break-word !important;\n    overflow-wrap: anywhere !important;\n    display: inline !important;\n  }\n  mjx-mrow {\n    white-space: normal !important;\n    word-break: break-word !important;\n    overflow-wrap: anywhere !important;\n    display: inline !important;\n    flex-wrap: wrap !important;\n  }\n  mjx-mo, mjx-mi, mjx-mn, mjx-mtext, mjx-texatom {\n    white-space: normal !important;\n    display: inline !important;\n  }\n\n  /* Two Column Continuous Stream Layout */\n  .sections-content-wrapper.two-column-layout,\n  .two-column-layout .sections-content-wrapper {\n    column-count: 2;\n    column-gap: 22px;\n    column-fill: auto;\n    column-rule: 1px solid #cbd5e1;\n    width: 100%;\n  }\n\n  @media print {\n    body { padding: 0; background: #ffffff; }\n    .page { max-width: 100%; }\n    .sections-content-wrapper.two-column-layout,\n    .two-column-layout .sections-content-wrapper {\n      column-count: 2;\n      column-gap: 18px;\n      column-fill: auto;\n      column-rule: 1px solid #cbd5e1;\n    }\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"executive-header\">\n    <img src=\"logo1.png\" alt=\"Logo\" class=\"exec-logo\">\n    <h1 class=\"exec-org-title\">{SUBTITLE}</h1>\n    <div class=\"executive-meta\">\n      <div>BATCH: {BATCH}</div>\n      <div>SET: {SET}</div>\n      <div>DATE: {DATE}</div>\n      <div>DURATION: {DURATION} MIN</div>\n      <div>MAX MARKS: {MAX_MARKS}</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"sections-content-wrapper\">\n    <!-- AI will populate section content here -->\n  </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>",
    "sample": "\n<div class=\"executive-sec-header\">\n  <span class=\"executive-badge\">Section A</span>\n  <span class=\"executive-title\">Physics</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"executive-instruction\">Answer all questions. Marks for each question are indicated against it.</div>\n<div class=\"exec-q-row\">\n  <div class=\"exec-q-meta\">\n    <span class=\"exec-q-num\">Question 1</span>\n    <span class=\"exec-q-marks\">(2 Marks)</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"exec-q-body\">A body of mass 2 kg moves with velocity \\(v = 3t^2\\). Find the force acting on it at \\(t = 2\\,\\text{s}\\).</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"exec-q-row\">\n  <div class=\"exec-q-meta\">\n    <span class=\"exec-q-num\">Question 2</span>\n    <span class=\"exec-q-marks\">(3 Marks)</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"exec-q-body\">State and prove the work&ndash;energy theorem for a variable force.</div>\n</div>",
