    "sample": "\n<div class=\"cyber-section\">\n  <div class=\"cyber-banner\">\n    <span class=\"cyber-badge\">// Section A</span>\n    <span class=\"cyber-title\">Physics</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"cyber-instruction\">/* Answer all questions. Marks for each question are indicated against it. */</div>\n  <div class=\"cyber-q-box\">\n    <div class=\"cyber-q-header\"><span>[SYS_REQ_Q1]</span><span>POINTS: 2</span></div>\n    <div class=\"cyber-q-body\">A body of mass 2 kg moves with velocity \\(v = 3t^2\\). Find the force acting on it at \\(t = 2\\,\\text{s}\\).</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"cyber-q-box\">\n    <div class=\"cyber-q-header\"><span>[SYS_REQ_Q2]</span><span>POINTS: 3</span></div>\n    <div class=\"cyber-q-body\">State and prove the work&ndash;energy theorem for a variable force.</div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
